Wildflower synthetic data — the Ashford family
===============================================

This repository's code and its synthetic records are the Wildflower project's
(see README.md, "Licensing"). Every person, account, address and identifier in
the data set is fictional.

It also carries one third-party file, under its own licence:

sources/dicom/lidc-idri-0002-chest-pa-ds4.dcm
(and every file derived from it, including dicom/warren-ashford-chest-x-ray.dcm
in the published data set)

  A posteroanterior (PA) chest radiograph (DX) of subject LIDC-IDRI-0002 from
  The Cancer Imaging Archive (TCIA) LIDC-IDRI collection:

    Armato III, S. G., McLennan, G., Bidaut, L., McNitt-Gray, M. F., Meyer,
    C. R., Reeves, A. P., Zhao, B., Aberle, D. R., Henschke, C. I., Hoffman,
    E. A., Kazerooni, E. A., MacMahon, H., van Beek, E. J. R., Yankelevitz, D.,
    et al. (2015). Data From LIDC-IDRI [Data set]. The Cancer Imaging Archive.
    https://doi.org/10.7937/K9/TCIA.2015.LO9QL9SX

  Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported License
  (CC BY 3.0): http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/

  Modified: downsampled 4x (to 501x430), and its header re-identified with
  synthetic values — the patient's name, sex, birth date and ID, the study
  dates and times, and every instance UID are rewritten for the fictional
  Warren Ashford, and private tags are removed (see Wildflower's
  synthetic-data-core `DicomImage.reidentify`). The source file itself is the
  downsampled image with TCIA's de-identified header.

  Per TCIA's data usage policy, no attempt may be made to re-identify the
  person this image was taken of. The synthetic identity it carries is not
  theirs.

